{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>day.txt 是一款把每一天化成獨立一頁純文字畫布的筆記 App，開啟即可直接輸入行程、構思、會議記錄或清單，毋須建立版面，也不用維護資料夾結構。適合偏好極簡書寫、不想被格式與分類干擾的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-57.webp\">\n<h2>每日一頁專注書寫</h2>\n<p>筆記儲存於本機，經私人 iCloud 在 Mac、iPhone 與 iPad 同步，毋須另設帳戶，內容不會送往 day.txt 伺服器，離線亦可書寫與搜尋。以箭頭或日曆切換日期，標記顯示哪些日子已有筆記。段落以 ### 開首即成捷徑，可快速跳至所屬章節；以 &gt;&gt;&gt; 與 &lt;&lt;&lt; 包住的文字能帶到當日筆記，適合留下未完成任務。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-466-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-467-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-468-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-469-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-470-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-471-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：day.txt</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T23:03:32.631491+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T22:56:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T10:18:39.772391+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T22:57:55.306949+00:00","content_hash":"2a6561185e569ab942ed3d8457c3e7b6bb0204e3c1a68c2d2e4405998191e24e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}